  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v7.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "a4768d2ace8d95eb5c458ed64c002d5f883e14923df93665c276ed38f71f1426",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "edb02a18428abffcaf9e72e5e01aff65a3ff3e658d8cb4b55a3f6951f4b888ce",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nBig Red Truck",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b3dd3c7df2604c2e1a07ef61af68508d0ea813957d77d17c5a6580c944a3d3fd",
      "text": "A big red truck rolled by.\n“Look at those wheels!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8c08bf7eef882895eb43e9aac8885ca5bc57009a0d0ba397f319e8a291264440",
      "text": "Ben waved at the station.\n“Come and look!”\nWukong had questions.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aa8e14870334feb71944672c079a9332448f73975f51933de1cfe529a207d510",
      "text": "“Why the big boots?”\n“They help protect my feet.”\nWukong looked at his shoes.\n“Mine are only squeaky!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90f5a15ecd2735380947ba7504f7c6cc78374b39073c87b2f64b10d88e43a057",
      "text": "Ben gave him a play hat.\nIt slipped over his eyes.\n“Do firefighters need eyes?”\n“Yes!” laughed Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "477b26f2613c4b561612ca114cb16f33061b411af99eebbe1a5693291625ee61",
      "text": "Ben showed his special mask.\n“It helps me breathe\nclean air.”\nHis voice sounded funny.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0f3fe9b904674c54b9aa583ff85c5f53294dd6836ad414d1fce323b76f9567c2",
      "text": "“Still me!” said Ben.\nWukong waved back.\n“Hello, funny-voice Ben!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "75a2e5a8f1b881622e8975b8c1a193cedeae4a6238880abf010bcecf53c4b866",
      "text": "“Is that a giant noodle?”\n“A hose!” said Ben.\n“It carries water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e170803e89266887246a5ddbe77a49a70091a5f05ed44f6cd54fda1918fe0096",
      "text": "Ben held the hose.\nWhoooosh went the water.\nA drop landed on Wukong’s\nnose.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "80690a08b1206ebbefb02056a41898f48fd80f1b5396d5246d1be30719bf338a",
      "text": "“And the ladder?”\n“It helps us reach up high.”\nWukong stayed down below.\nHis tail reached up.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ed9b7706a86f965c9d6b32876fe8ee3bf3d0b0e0a3d3c9aeb9aee1ca67a67fe7",
      "text": "Then Ben showed an alarm.\n“Beep! Beep! Beep!”\n“It tells us to get out.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6c5942b155b8786d13b9ae844d87542ae2ff6458ccbce46a42384888dae97e2b",
      "text": "“If it beeps, go outside.”\nThey practiced the way out.\n“Then stay outside,” said Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ba31373cbbbf72e80c1d3f2e4d51808ba027dfc942d670ffaf2ad4e19e3eccfd",
      "text": "They picked a meeting tree.\n“Count noses!” said Wukong.\nPigsy counted his twice.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e6e61cbe081d51e7f2c34d59e7b705188db312b4fe354420941b701d36d022c",
      "text": "Wukong thanked Ben.\n“Big truck. Big job.\nBig kind heart.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3b867f7926b9edf1d0ff431b57f4ed0c691b1907688fd9b8396a929291e070c9",
      "text": "At home, his toy truck went\nwee-oo… wee-oo…\nThen quieter.\nThen… shhh.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b6f73ed64a65ca305544553acdeaadd6f21c788246714b8caec4180c424d049",
      "text": "He tucked in his toy truck.\n“Goodnight, helpers.”\nThe whole room felt quiet.\nSo did he.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
